WEBVTT

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:16.910
Alright!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.990
This time I will for sure confess my love for him!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.040
I'm starving!

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.250
Let's go ahead and eat.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:02.760
But Dad said, "You don't have to buy food tonight, I'll bring fish home."

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.520
He's said that many times.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.520
Come on.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.190
Time to eat!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:08.930
I'm home!

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.680
Finally.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.530
What's the matter with you? All you care about is fishing.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:20.030
No... Well... I... It's because we had a great conversation.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.180
Come in please.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:25.440
Come on! You should have told me we were having a guest.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:29.920
This is Hasegawa Shingo-kun. We were fishing together today.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.420
Welcome, please come in.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.570
Good evening.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:47.420
Fishing for Love.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:13.540
Doremi-chan, what's the matter? Somethin' ain't right with ya.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.720
Why is Hasegawa-kun so handsome?

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.220
No way, Doremi-chan... again?

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.770
Dodo!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.270
Is that so?

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:37.440
So Hasegawa-kun fishes together with Doremi-chan's dad.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.150
Right, right.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:43.280
But unlike my dad, he's so very easygoing.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.910
But they fish together, so he's probably like an old geezer.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.540
He is not! Hasegawa-kun is a 6th grader.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.750
In fact, last Sunday...

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.920
My dad brought him to my house for the first time!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.880
So love at first sight?

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.840
I think it could it be that we met by fate.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.800
Yer so fulla yourself!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:10.140
You know what? This weekend, Hasegawa-kun is going fishing and camping with my family.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.810
Isn't that great?

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.520
But, I feel uneasy about it.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.480
I couldn't even confess to Igarashi-sempai of the soccer club.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:24.200
You always have trouble confessing to someone you like, Doremi-chan.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:28.160
So basically, yer sayin' this happens every time she falls in love?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.620
T-This time I'll try my best!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:35.120
I'm a witch apprentice who has learned how to use magic!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.590
So that means ya became an apprentice just fer that!?

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.380
Don't put it like that!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:44.010
Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan, please go camping with me!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.760
Hey! Don't get in the way, Dodo.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:53.270
Pretty please! Help Hasegawa-kun and me get a good start.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:57.480
Sure! We'll do our best to help you.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.730
Yeah! Just say whatcha want.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.780
Thank you.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.200
Anyway, what should I do?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:09.030
Piece of cake! Yer gonna get closer if ya got the same interests.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:13.160
Right, if Doremi-chan knew how to fish, it would be easy to strike up a conversation.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.620
Oh really!? Alright!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:20.380
There's no customers now., so let's practice some fishing.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.860
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.270
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.070
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.320
Wait just a second!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.780
Let me make some fishin' rods.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.450
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.200
Fishin' rods, appear!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.380
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.090
Tank with fish appear!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.850
Isn't this a bit too big?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:19.900
You think so?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.870
And it flooded everywhere.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.080
What did you do!?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.370
What in the world!?

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:44.730
We're going camping this weekend, so we're practicing fishing.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.840
What did you say? <i>This</i>  weekend!?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:48.760
The store!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.410
I didn't think of that!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.800
Oh yeah...

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.270
I see. You want to go camping instead of tending the store.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:58.980
Sure, that's fine.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.270
Really? Thank you, Majo Rika.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.110
It's nice to have some outdoor activity once in a while.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.980
Looking at the starry sky, eating baked fish we catch ourselves.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:07.940
It sounds great.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:17.540
Majo Rika thinks she's going too.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.000
Looks like it.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.160
What are we going to do?

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.380
Hey, hey.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.090
She could bring us trouble. Should we sneak out and go without her?

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:30.010
Y-yeah, if we said she can't go, she wouldn't allow us to go either.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.340
A-Agreed.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:32.390
Okay.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.270
I never expected her to come along on a fishing trip.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.280
I made this for you, Hasegawa-kun!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.490
Doremi is my daughter after all.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:56.740
"Thanks, it's really delicious," he'll say. Or something.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:00.200
Alright, today we'll reel in some big fish.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.670
Alright, today I'll reel in some carp. (Koi = carp; love)

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.960
What am I going to do if Doremi takes to fishing?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.050
I wouldn't worry about that.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:13.940
It's pretty obvious why Doremi is acting that way.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.760
Pop, where are you going?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.180
I have a date today with Jiro-kun at the park.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.940
After that Koro-kun will take me home.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.900
They're both my classmates from the kindergarten.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.020
Okay, I'm leaving now.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.820
I'm worried about her too.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.660
Ahhh, what a fine day today.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.120
Oh? What's this?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.960
It looks like a note.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:44.080
"Please take care of the store. Best regards from the apprentices."

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.270
Those little...!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:49.000
They were planning to ditch me from the very beginning!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.760
I won't ever forget this!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:07.810
Dodo!

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:08.620
What is it?

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:12.570
I-I-I was just wondering how many fish we're gonna catch.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:15.530
I'm here, so we'll catch a lot for sure.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.030
T-That's right.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.820
Hey, Dodo!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.700
This is the lunchbox I made specially for Hasegawa-kun!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.910
Why did you have to come along?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.000
Doremi-chan.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.960
Actually, I did the same thing.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.920
We'd feel bad if we had to leave them at home,

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.250
so we took them with us.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.880
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.310
We've arrived!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.260
Hey!

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:44.770
Hasegawa-kun.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.810
So that's Hasegawa-kun, huh?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.310
He's so Doremi-chan's type.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.110
That's right.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.980
Harukaze-san, good luck today.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.530
Yeah, let's have fun fishing.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.160
Doremi-chan, is this your first time fishing?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.530
If there's anything you don't understand, just ask me.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.010
I... I will!

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.750
That's a good start.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.550
I brought some friends.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:10.460
Hadzuki-chan and Aiko-chan.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.400
Good day.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.130
Nice to meetcha.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.340
Actually, me too.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:15.920
This is my father.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:18.500
Father?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:22.350
Am I going to meet the father of my boyfriend-to-be already?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:29.730
How do you do? Your son has some great fishing skills.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.360
I wish I had a son like yours.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:36.360
I think it's pointless to have great fishing skills.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.150
Dad!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:41.070
Today is his last day fishing anyway.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:42.700
I'm sorry.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.780
It's alright.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.080
But, why did he say it's your last day fishing?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.040
I'm going to take the junior high entrance exam next year.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.250
So I'm not allowed to go fishing until the exam is over.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.960
I see.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.670
Father doesn't like it when I indulge in fishing.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:02.050
But I wish Father would understand how fun fishing is.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.970
So, I forced him to come with me today.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:08.980
That way I thought he might understand my feelings.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.480
I see! I'll do my best to help you.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.270
Harukaze-san.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:17.230
If I lost my partner, I'd be very lonely.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:19.650
Please do.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.490
He's got so many problems.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:24.910
I feel bad for Hasegawa-kun.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.770
Got it? You absolutely cannot leave the car, okay?

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.790
After all the trouble they took to get here, that ain't fair!

00:11:56.790 --> 00:12:00.490
But, Dodo might bring us trouble if she's out.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.780
She already ate the lunchbox I made.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:09.330
This camping trip is very important to Doremi-chan's love life.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:10.080
Yer right.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.460
Don't waste time here.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.000
Go ask Hasegawa-kun to show you some things.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.500
Hasegawa-kun!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.820
Could ya teach Doremi-chan how to fish?

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.010
Please.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.720
Oh, alright!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.260
But... I...

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.180
Whatcha waitin' for? We got this far already!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.350
But I'm not prepared.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.890
Use mine!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.350
Well... I...

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:36.360
Pull yerself together!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.740
Please teach me everything you can.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.860
Well, I'll teach how to use the rod and the reel first.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.570
Sir, would you like to try?

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:48.030
No, I'm fine.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:49.950
Got one!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.210
Oh, today's first catch?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:04.130
Oh, so this is definitely worth skipping the lab lesson for, isn't it?

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.010
Shingo-kun, don't mind him.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.980
Alright, I'm going to get a big one next!

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.200
Didn't get any.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.750
Well well, this is such a waste of time.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:46.550
This is getting gloomier... Not a good time to confess.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.560
If this keeps up...

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.140
Yer right.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:55.100
Doremi-chan!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.910
I'm gonna use magic, see if I can do somethin'.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:00.900
Really?

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:04.250
Thanks, that's what I expect from my fellow apprentices.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.030
Leave it to me.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.990
Guys, I'm gonna go to the restroom!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:16.140
Alrighty, I'm gonna use magic to make 'em catch a boatload of fish!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:16.580
Yeah!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.550
What're they doin'?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.890
They want to catch the fish.

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.260
No way they can do that.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.140
In that case...

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.660
It's pulling strong. Maybe it's a really big fish.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:56.370
As I expected from Ai-chan and Hadzuki-chan. The mood will get better now.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.210
Dodo is?

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.790
This is bad! Change Dodo into a bass with magic!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:06.380
No, Ai-chan, bass live in the sea!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:12.510
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.810
Alright!

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:23.440
I told you that you should have focused on your studies instead of going fishing.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:30.860
B-But a carp banner is much closer to a fish than an empty can.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.660
It's fine! You don't need to console me.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.660
Ah! I failed again.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.460
Dodo, we're really sorry.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.670
I was too nervous to use the right magic.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.300
I'm really sorry.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.060
What is it?

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.220
What's going on?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.030
What a big catch! What a haul!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:24.640
What? We ain't gettin' any fish because Majo Rika's hoggin' all the fish to herself.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:27.040
She must be angry about being ditched.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.880
Looks like they aren't catching any fish.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.930
I feel bad for them.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.930
Never mind them. That's what they get for ditching me.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.270
Majo Rika, we're sorry.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.640
You've been so kind to us. We're so sorry.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:44.900
You idiots!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:49.150
We've arranged a special service for ya as our way to say sorry.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.110
There is a hot spring with a great view over there.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.400
A hot spring?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.580
This must be a trick. Humpf! I'm not going!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:02.080
Well, how 'bout I give ya a massage?

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.540
I'll rub your back.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.000
Whatever shall I do?

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.460
Well, shall we?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.420
Come on.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:13.420
Sounds good to me.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.180
Come on, Majo Rika.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.720
Well, it's not a trip without going to a hot spring.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.220
That's great.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.060
Let's go.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.410
Maybe there's no fish left in this lake!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.330
Shingo, it's time to conclude your fishing.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.870
Traffic's gonna be bad, so we have to get back early tomorrow morning.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:57.220
We didn't catch any fish at all. This mood is the worst.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.850
Dad, thank you for coming with me.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:06.100
The last time you camped with me was when I was in kindergarten.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.270
I had a lot of fun.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.190
Hey!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.900
I finally got one!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.740
I hope it's not another carp banner.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.250
Oh! Doremi!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.460
Yes, yes, don't be nervous. Reel it in slowly.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.210
That's right, that's it.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.430
I did it!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:45.390
Well done. That's my daughter.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.900
It's pulling so strong. It must be a big one.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:03.740
Dad!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.990
What are you doing? Pull!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.590
Alright! Keep it up!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.960
Hasegawa-kun, hang in there!

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.010
I did it.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:30.850
Amazing! Simply amazing! This is the biggest one today!

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.280
Thanks to you, Dad.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.780
F-Fishing... is quite alright.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.920
But, how come there are a lot of fish all of a sudden?

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.440
Doremi-chan, that's wonderful.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:57.170
This is thanks to Dodo and the others.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.930
Majo Rika was keepin' all the fish to herself. Dodo and the others helped release them.

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.090
Majo Rika!?

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.050
Lake Hot Spring

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.060
What kind of hot spring is this!?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.000
Does it really matter, Majo Rika?

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.350
It does to me!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:12.020
The view is actually quite nice here.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.080
Hasegawa-kun is alone.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.150
Alright.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.410
G-Get going, Doremi!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.380
Doremi-chan.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.590
H-Hello.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:44.630
Earlier, Dad said I can continue fishing.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:45.510
Really?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.010
Yeah, thanks for all your help.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.180
It was great that you and your friends came.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.650
They're gettin' along.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:56.980
This should go smoothly.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.320
Oh yeah, how about makin' the mood a bit more romantic?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.900
T-This is it! This is a good chance to confess!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.740
U-Um...

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.620
The stars are so beautiful, don't you think?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:11.240
Yeah.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.460
I-It feels so romantic...

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:19.830
Yeah.

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.090
He said, "Yeah."

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.130
T-Then, next time...

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:26.130
Next time, after my exam.

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:28.890
If it's alright with you, will you...

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.240
Will I...?

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:31.600
Will you...

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.140
I'm coming with my girlfriend.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.850
He already has a girlfriend?

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:41.440
Fireworks?

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.120
The heart-shaped fireworks make my heart ache.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:58.170
I'm definitely the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.880
Yada-kun and I went to the same kindergarten.

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:05.890
Huh? Ya mean Yada-kun the delinquent?

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:07.150
Actually, he has a kind heart.

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:10.830
When I was little, he took me home when I fell.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:14.560
But he didn't even take that test or sing in music class.

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.120
He's easy to misunderstand, but he's not a bad guy.

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:19.310
Then what about when he fought with those junior high students?

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:22.780
Oh no! Yada-kun has been arrested!

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:23.780
No way!

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:24.810
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:26.870
Yada-kun is a Delinquent!?

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:29.140
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
